    "title": "Federal officer shoots man in the leg in Minneapolis after alleged attack during stop, DHS says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Lavietes ,\n8 hours ago MINNEAPOLIS — A federal officer shot a man in the leg during an attempted traffic stop Wednesday night, the Department of Homeland Security said as a crowd of protesters gathered near the shooting site, about 12 miles from where an ICE officer fatally shot Renee Nicole Good last week. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
